INSERT OR REPLACE INTO pages (slug, title, url, text) VALUES ('cel-seminar-adaptation-planning-to-sea-level-rise', 'CEL Seminar - Adaptation Planning to Sea Level Rise', '/cel-seminar-adaptation-planning-to-sea-level-rise/', 'June 2nd, 2023 10:30AM-12:00PM Title: Adaptation Planning to Sea Level Rise Dr. Zhong-Ren Peng is Professor of Urban and Regional Planning and Director of iAdapt: International Center for Adaptation Planning and Design, at the College of Design, Construction and Planning, University of Florida. His research focuses on three areas, such as: 1) Sustainable and resilient transportation planning, 2) Adaptation planning for climate change, and 3) Urban planning AI. He has published 172 journal articles, two books, and 10 book chapters across multiple disciplines. Among them, 46 articles are “extremely highly cited,” according to Dimensions Analytics. Based on Google Scholar, his total citation is 9335, h-index 49, i10-index 150, which ranks him as the top 1% of planning scholars in the world. Dr. Peng’s important work in urban planning has earned a great reputation in the global planning community, and he has been frequently invited to give keynote speeches in different conferences, including the renowned European Forum Alpbach, along with Nobel laureates and academicians. Categories: NEWS 0 Comments Leave a Reply Cancel reply Your email address will not be published. Required fields are marked * Name * Email * Website What''s on your mind? Search for: Recent Posts [Field Trip] 2026-2 Urban Planning and Zoning Class The commencement day of Lili [Conference] Professor Steven Jige Quan at the 7th LH Global Business Convention (WSCE 2026) Professor Quan gave an online lecture on presentation title: "Examining Model Accuracy and Reliability of Explanations in Explainable Machine Learning for Urban Studies: A Case Study of Residential Building Energy Use in Seoul"at the machine learning methods forum Professor Quan delivered a lecture on "Explainable Machine Learning in Urban Research" at the Machine Learning Methods Forum at Chongqing University. Recent Comments ปั้มไลค์ on Joint Seminar with Hanyang University''s Urban Design and Spatial Analysis Lab Archives November 2026 September 2026 August 2026 May 2026 April 2026 March 2026 February 2026 December 2025 September 2025 August 2025 June 2025 February 2025 January 2025 November 2024 October 2024 April 2024 March 2024 January 2024 October 2023 July 2023 May 2023 April 2023 February 2023 November 2022 August 2022 May 2022 April 2022 March 2022 December 2021 October 2021 August 2021 October 2019 July 2019 May 2019 March 2019 June 2017 Categories NEWS Principle Investigator / Publications Uncategorized Meta Log in Entries feed Comments feed WordPress.org');
