INSERT OR REPLACE INTO pages (slug, title, url, text) VALUES ('lab-dinner-and-day-trip-with-prof-yuan-lai', 'Lab dinner and day-trip with Prof. Yuan Lai', '/lab-dinner-and-day-trip-with-prof-yuan-lai/', 'December 12th-13th, 2024 We were honored to invite Professor Lai Yuan to our lab dinner, where we had the opportunity to engage in meaningful discussions on urban planning experiences in South Korea and China. Before the dinner, we guided Professor Lai on a tour of Seoul National University and the vibrant Gangnam district, offering insights into the city''s urban landscape. Throughout the evening, Professor Lai shared valuable perspectives and provided thoughtful guidance on various planning topics. The exchange was both inspiring and enriching for everyone involved. Categories: Uncategorized 0 Comments Leave a Reply Cancel reply Your email address will not be published. Required fields are marked * Name * Email * Website What''s on your mind? Search for: Recent Posts [Field Trip] 2026-2 Urban Planning and Zoning Class The commencement day of Lili [Conference] Professor Steven Jige Quan at the 7th LH Global Business Convention (WSCE 2026) Professor Quan gave an online lecture on presentation title: "Examining Model Accuracy and Reliability of Explanations in Explainable Machine Learning for Urban Studies: A Case Study of Residential Building Energy Use in Seoul"at the machine learning methods forum Professor Quan delivered a lecture on "Explainable Machine Learning in Urban Research" at the Machine Learning Methods Forum at Chongqing University. Recent Comments ปั้มไลค์ on Joint Seminar with Hanyang University''s Urban Design and Spatial Analysis Lab Archives November 2026 September 2026 August 2026 May 2026 April 2026 March 2026 February 2026 December 2025 September 2025 August 2025 June 2025 February 2025 January 2025 November 2024 October 2024 April 2024 March 2024 January 2024 October 2023 July 2023 May 2023 April 2023 February 2023 November 2022 August 2022 Ma