INSERT OR REPLACE INTO pages (slug, title, url, text) VALUES ('lab-event-celebrating-teachers-day', '[Lab Event] Celebrating Teachers’ Day', '/lab-event-celebrating-teachers-day/', 'To mark Teachers’ Day, members of the City Energy Lab collaborated with alumni to create a video message expressing their gratitude and appreciation to Professor Steven Jige Quan. The video brought together messages from both current and former lab members, reflecting on shared experiences and acknowledging the professor’s continued guidance and support. Lab members watched the video together with Professor Quan during the celebration. Following the screening, the lab presented Professor Quan with gifts and a cake as a token of appreciation. The event provided a meaningful opportunity for current members and alumni to reconnect and celebrate the mentorship and contributions that have shaped the lab community. Categories: Uncategorized 0 Comments Leave a Reply Cancel reply Your email address will not be published. Required fields are marked * Name * Email * Website What''s on your mind? Search for: Recent Posts [Field Trip] 2026-2 Urban Planning and Zoning Class The commencement day of Lili [Conference] Professor Steven Jige Quan at the 7th LH Global Business Convention (WSCE 2026) Professor Quan gave an online lecture on presentation title: "Examining Model Accuracy and Reliability of Explanations in Explainable Machine Learning for Urban Studies: A Case Study of Residential Building Energy Use in Seoul"at the machine learning methods forum Professor Quan delivered a lecture on "Explainable Machine Learning in Urban Research" at the Machine Learning Methods Forum at Chongqing University. Recent Comments ปั้มไลค์ on Joint Seminar with Hanyang University''s Urban Design and Spatial Analysis Lab Archives November 2026 September 2026 August 2026 May 2026 April 2026 March 2026 February 2026 December 2025 September 2025 August 2025 June 2025 February 2025 January 2025 November 2024 October 202