INSERT OR REPLACE INTO pages (slug, title, url, text) VALUES ('lab-trip-exploring-urban-waterfront-revitalization-hongje-waterfall-site-visit', '[Lab Trip] Exploring Urban Waterfront Revitalization: Hongje Waterfall Site Visit', '/lab-trip-exploring-urban-waterfront-revitalization-hongje-waterfall-site-visit/', 'The lab visited Hongje Falls, one of Seoul’s waterfront revitalization projects, as part of the city’s water-based urban activation strategy. The trip continued along Hongjecheon and into Yeonhui-dong, allowing for observation of how restored waterways interact with adjacent residential and commercial areas. Through walking the site, the team examined spatial connections between water infrastructure, public space, and neighborhood fabric, as well as the role of such projects in enhancing urban livability. Categories: Uncategorized 0 Comments Leave a Reply Cancel reply Your email address will not be published. Required fields are marked * Name * Email * Website What''s on your mind? Search for: Recent Posts [Field Trip] 2026-2 Urban Planning and Zoning Class The commencement day of Lili [Conference] Professor Steven Jige Quan at the 7th LH Global Business Convention (WSCE 2026) Professor Quan gave an online lecture on presentation title: "Examining Model Accuracy and Reliability of Explanations in Explainable Machine Learning for Urban Studies: A Case Study of Residential Building Energy Use in Seoul"at the machine learning methods forum Professor Quan delivered a lecture on "Explainable Machine Learning in Urban Research" at the Machine Learning Methods Forum at Chongqing University. Recent Comments ปั้มไลค์ on Joint Seminar with Hanyang University''s Urban Design and Spatial Analysis Lab Archives November 2026 September 2026 August 2026 May 2026 April 2026 March 2026 February 2026 December 2025 September 2025 August 2025 June 2025 February 2025 January 2025 November 2024 October 2024 April 2024 March 2024 January 2024 October 2023 July 2023 May 2023 April 2