INSERT OR REPLACE INTO pages (slug, title, url, text) VALUES ('professor-quan-and-lab-members-attended-aaai-workshops-for-urban-planning-in-singapore', 'Professor Quan and Lab members attended AAAI workshops for urban planning in Singapore.', '/professor-quan-and-lab-members-attended-aaai-workshops-for-urban-planning-in-singapore/', 'Screenshot January 26th, 2026 Most of our lab members had a presentation on AAAI workshops in Singapore. As one of commitee, Professor Steven Jige Quan presented on “Revealing Hidden Archetypes of Urban Morphological Patterns in Seoul" as well as hosted panel session. Heesoo presented in Task / Problem Definition session on “Urban-Net: A Standardized Dataset for AI for Sustainable City Planning“. Seojung presented her work in tutorial session on"Implementation of ChatGPT-Assisted Planning Support Systems Platform“. Hoon Seock, Lili, Inseong, Sihyeon, Subin and Yeqin presented their works in posters session, seperatively. https://ai-for-urban-planning.github.io/AAAI26-workshop Categories: Uncategorized 0 Comments Leave a Reply Cancel reply Your email address will not be published. Required fields are marked * Name * Email * Website What''s on your mind? Search for: Recent Posts [Field Trip] 2026-2 Urban Planning and Zoning Class The commencement day of Lili [Conference] Professor Steven Jige Quan at the 7th LH Global Business Convention (WSCE 2026) Professor Quan gave an online lecture on presentation title: "Examining Model Accuracy and Reliability of Explanations in Explainable Machine Learning for Urban Studies: A Case Study of Residential Building Energy Use in Seoul"at the machine learning methods forum Professor Quan delivered a lecture on "Explainable Machine Learning in Urban Research" at the Machine Learning Methods Forum at Chongqing University. Recent Comments ปั้มไลค์ on Joint Seminar with Hanyang University''s Urban Design and Spatial Analysis Lab Archives November 2026 September 2026 August 2026 May 2026 April 2026 March 20