INSERT OR REPLACE INTO pages (slug, title, url, text) VALUES ('professor-quan-and-lili-lin-yoojung-choi-attended-cupum-conference-in-london-uk', 'Professor Quan and Lili Lin, Yoojung Choi attended CUPUM conference in London, UK', '/professor-quan-and-lili-lin-yoojung-choi-attended-cupum-conference-in-london-uk/', 'June 23rd – June 26th, 2025 Professor Quan hosted the session of ''Large Language Models & Generative AI – 3''; and presented his work, ''A New Paradigm in Technical Support for Planning Participation: ChatGPT-Assisted and AI-Powered Planning Support Systems''. Master''s student Lili Lin presented her work, ''Knowledge Graph Generation from Urban Planning Texts: Climate Change Adaptation in Master Plans of New York and Shanghai''. Master''s student Yoojung Choi presented her work – ''Enhancing Urban Building Energy Modeling with Transfer Learning: A Multi-City Study in Korea'' via poster. Categories: Uncategorized 0 Comments Leave a Reply Cancel reply Your email address will not be published. Required fields are marked * Name * Email * Website What''s on your mind? Search for: Recent Posts [Field Trip] 2026-2 Urban Planning and Zoning Class The commencement day of Lili [Conference] Professor Steven Jige Quan at the 7th LH Global Business Convention (WSCE 2026) Professor Quan gave an online lecture on presentation title: "Examining Model Accuracy and Reliability of Explanations in Explainable Machine Learning for Urban Studies: A Case Study of Residential Building Energy Use in Seoul"at the machine learning methods forum Professor Quan delivered a lecture on "Explainable Machine Learning in Urban Research" at the Machine Learning Methods Forum at Chongqing University. Recent Comments ปั้มไลค์ on Joint Seminar with Hanyang University''s Urban Design and Spatial Analysis Lab Archives November 2026 September 2026 August 2026 May 2026 April 2026 March 2026 February 2026 December 2025 September 2025 August 2025 June 2025 February 2025 January 2025 November 2024 